{"version":1,"key":"card:128","content":{"id":128,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c41a19ad-7b79-44d1-a050-d7a7c6112da6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Commander 的下载与使用。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"84689306-1082-44d5-b583-85b1970be659","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"705d5cd1-8633-4ddf-866e-ee0b2523737e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"npm install commander","collabId":"08415869-409a-41d4-af9f-3f41da8b9874","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0edf1fb-39cc-45a8-aa18-3851b44727a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先明白，Commander 的作用是什么，是解析命令行参数，让我们能够以易读且方便的拿到我们想要的选项和参数，而不用手动解析字符串。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9a1a1ee4-d49f-4cdb-81d7-38a3686d45aa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"举个🌰："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"76e5c4fa-5ea3-4eb7-b4b0-8a0920648b27","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3d30c407-31f8-4d86-a2f9-3d0a47f63f91","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const { program } = require('commander');\n\n// 定义要解析的选项\nprogram.option('-n, --name', '这是对选项的说明', '这是默认值');\n\n// 解析命令行参数\nprogram.parse();\n\n// 获取被解析的选项\nconst options = program.opts();\nconsole.log(options);","collabId":"5e614363-e8e9-478e-911f-79d18a443b64","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"22a56f41-5f7f-4c99-99ca-a6766ac8666d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"1fd0b459-1734-42f5-a875-49cb2cb30772","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ node demo.js --name\n{ name: true }","collabId":"b9abf53b-36dc-433d-aede-596f160591c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"],"createTime":1689258789780,"updateTime":1743303640393,"linkedCards":[{"id":129,"target":{"key":"card:129","type":"card","id":129},"summary":"Commander 选项分为短选项和长选项，短选项使用 - 开头，接 单个字符 ，长选项使用 -- 开头，后接一个或多个单词（使用 - 连接）。 const { program } = require('commander'); // 短选...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]},{"id":131,"target":{"key":"card:131","type":"card","id":131},"summary":"选项后的参数可能是多个值，使用 <...> 或 [...] 的语法来表示是变长参数 program .option('--book <book>') .option('--author <author...>') .option('--pr...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]},{"id":130,"target":{"key":"card:130","type":"card","id":130},"summary":"Commander 对于选项参数的读取是贪婪的，如果定义了某个选项后需要跟参数，但是实际上没有给参数，那么会把后面的选项读取为参数 const { program } = require('commander'); program .opt...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640393}}